No, you did it right.

You probably just didn't need to do it when you did.

Spoilers...

If you Wield it, it will act as a long sword.  Which is the best non-
magical weapon.  It also has the bonus of being rustproof.  So use it
on those Black Puddings.

If you #apply it, it will cure you of various ailments.  Try to apply
it when you're blind, hallucinating, stunned, etc....

Just for fun, apply it when it's cursed.

O.K., don't do that.  It will hurt you.



